shlokas.sanskrit_hinglish:
Na cha etad vidmah kataranno gariyo;
 yadva jayem yadi va no jayeyuh;
 yanev hatva na jijivisham;
 ste'vasthitah pramukhe Dhartarastrah ||6||

Karpanyadosopahata swabhavah;
 prichhami tvam dharmasammudha chetah;
 yachchhreya syan nishchitam bruhi tan me;
 shishyas te'ham shadhi mam tvam prapannam ||7||

Sanjaya uvach:
 Evam uktva Hrishikesham Gudakeshah Parantapa;
 na yotsya iti Govindam uktva tushnim babhuvah ||9||

Shri Bhagavan uvach:
 Ashochyan anashochas tvam prajnavadansh cha bhashase;
 gatasona gatasonsh cha na anushochanti panditah ||11||

Na jayate mriyate va kadachi;
 nayam bhutva bhavita va na bhuyah;
 ajo nityah shashvato 'yam purano;
 na hanyate hanyamane sharire ||20||

Vasansi jirnani yatha vihaya;
 navani grihnati naro 'parani;
 tatha sharirani vihaya jirnani;
 anyani sanyati navani dehi ||22||

Ashcharyavat pashyati kaschiden;
 maashcharyavad vadati tathaiva chanya;
 ashcharyavac chainam anyah shrunoti;
 shrutvapy enam veda na chaiva kashchit ||29||

Arjuna uvacha:
 Sthita-prajñasya ka bhasha samadhisthasya Keshava;
 sthitadhiḥ kim prabhashet kim asit vrajet kim ||54||

Shri Bhagavan uvacha:
 Prajahati yada kaman sarvan Partha manogatān;
 atmanyevātmanā tuṣṭaḥ sthitaprajñastadocyate ||55||
